   143	/**
   144	 * Story 4: Save one Brief edit. The only Brief writer actions are: supply a
   145	 * Storyline (type into an empty one), edit the Storyline or an entry, or
   146	 * resolve a Storyline question.
   147	 *
   148	 * Every save inserts a NEW version (origin `edited`, with its edit
   149	 * magnitude) and never mutates a row; the next generation with the same
   150	 * inputsHash reuses that version. A save whose text equals the current text
   151	 * inserts nothing and returns the current briefId.
   152	 *
   153	 * - `editedStorylineText`: the Brief-level Storyline (`storylineText`).
   154	 * - `entryId` + `editedText`/`editedReason`/`editedConfidence`: one entry.
   155	 *   Editing a `storyline` claim changes that claim, never `storylineText`.
   156	 * - `entryId` + `resolvedBy`: resolve a Storyline question. `use_evidence`
   157	 *   sets `storylineText` to the question's alternative.
